{{smaller|'''Anaclastic vial.''' See ''anaclastic.''—'''Leyden vial.''' Same as ''Leyden jar'' (which see, under ''jar''<sup>3</sup>).—'''To pour out vials of wrath,''' to take vengeance; inflict judgment (Rev. xvi. 1); hence, colloquially, to become very angry; storm; rage.}}
